## 8️⃣ Mental Model (THIS IS THE KEY)

### Think in 3 steps for every Mockito test

#### 1. Arrange (stubbing)

> “If this method is called, what should happen?”

* `thenReturn()` → static response
* `thenAnswer()` → dynamic response

#### 2. Act

> “Call the method under test”

#### 3. Assert + Verify

> “Was the behavior correct AND were collaborators used correctly?”

