## 9️⃣ Interview-ready explanation (MEMORIZE)

If interviewer asks:

> “What’s the difference between thenReturn and thenAnswer?”

Say:

> “`thenReturn` returns a fixed value, while `thenAnswer` lets us compute the return value dynamically based on invocation arguments. I use `thenAnswer` when simulating repository save behavior or when the return depends on input.”

